<div class="admin-section-intro"><span class="admin-step-number">M</span><div><h2 id="community-tab-title">Mises en avant</h2><p>Décidez quelles annonces peuvent bénéficier d’une visibilité renforcée.</p></div></div>
<div class="community-record-list"><% @tops.each do |record| %><article class="card community-review-card"><div class="community-record-heading"><div><span class="network-badge network-badge-<%= record.status %>"><%= community_status(record.status) %></span><h3><%= record.listing.title %></h3></div></div><p><strong>Motif :</strong> <%= record.reason %></p><details><summary>Prendre une décision</summary><%= render "decision", record: record, operation: "review_top", choices: [["Approuver", "approved"], ["Refuser", "rejected"], ["Retirer", "withdrawn"]] %></details></article><% end %><% if @tops.empty? %><p class="network-empty">Aucune demande de mise en avant.</p><% end %></div>
